1) Yeni bir workspace olustur : nav_ws

2) cd nav_ws/src

3) git clone -b ros2 https://github.com/nobleo/rviz_satellite.git

4) rosdep install -i --from-path src --rosdistro humble -y --skip-keys="mapviz"

5) colcon build

6) Yeni bir terminal daha aç

7) gedit .bashrc

8) source ~/nav_ws/install/setup.bash  komutunu ekle

9) source .bashrc

10) ros2 launch rviz_satellite demo.launch.xml

11) Rviz ->> Add ->> ArialMap

12) Object URl
	OpenStreetMap: https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
	TomTom: https://api.tomtom.com/map/1/tile/basic/main/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?tileSize=512&key=[TOKEN]
    	Mapbox: https://api.mapbox.com/styles/v1/mapbox/satellite-v9/tiles/256/{z}/{x}/{y}?access_token=[TOKEN]
    	
13) Topic ->> /fix


